From a8a24b45e5f85d5a7256cf769aadb6e9a7022688 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 19:01:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix 16 security review findings with migrations, tests, and
 rollback

Address all findings from the security code review across 4 severity
tiers: demo password gating behind DEMO_MODE env var, CSRF protection
via header-required auth on POST endpoints, session invalidation on
password change, path traversal guard on document downloads, password
complexity enforcement, RBAC simulated mode logging, session cleanup
thread, file integrity checksums, filename sanitization, N+1 query
fix in RBAC engine, 9 database indexes, and RFC 5987 Content-Disposition.

Includes 4 migration scripts with rollback counterparts, a migration
runner (migrate.py), and a 24-test suite covering all fixes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SdiEK5rUwy3VC4zwZWiVJi
